he doesn't go and rush out.

cue0153104
00:11:56.000 --> 00:12:01.000
But he points out what are the basis for the disagreement.

cue0153105
00:12:01.000 --> 00:12:06.000
Now, the people who attacked Adam Baum,

cue0153106
