The movement actually was directed from France,

cue0153120
00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:53.000
from the north of France,

cue0153121
00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:58.000
and the Jews in Spain just followed that ideology.

cue0153122
00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:01.000
Now, some things happened,

cue0153123
00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:05.000
and I want to tell you one of the most interesting things that happened,

cue0153124
